        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2ab07903-e958-4af6-b01c-b62058745ce1).Image",
        "Description": "The Boss wants you to do a special job. One of our agents was missing yesterday morning. Old DDR friends suggest Agent Fyodorovisch &quot;Green&quot; played a double role. We lost many agents lately and the boss thinks he is the rat. You will arrive this evening in Berlin. Kill him and his associate. They might know youre comming. Be aware special agent 47. \r\rAs usual the money is being wired to your account as we speak.\r\rGoodluck",
